WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.949 --> 00:00:10.990
Google and Yahoo both use goats to trim their
lawns.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:16.020
There are more stretch limos in Glasgow than
in Los Angeles.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:21.199
New research shows that, for luxury brands
such as expensive perfumes and clothes, the

00:00:21.199 --> 00:00:24.680
ruder the sales staff are, the higher the
sales.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:32.079
In 2013, police in the Maldives arrested a
coconut on suspicion of vote rigging.

00:00:32.079 --> 00:00:38.390
Without bats tequila would not exist. It's
made from the agave plant, which is pollinated

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:42.460
by bats.
There are 20 million sea containers in the

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:46.780
world. The ships' crews have no idea what
is in them.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:53.340
Being lonely is as bad for your health as
smoking 15 cigarettes a day.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:01:00.199
The Aztecs wore necklaces made of popcorn.
Boys in Bronze Age Russia had to slay their

00:01:00.199 --> 00:01:04.360
own dogs to prove they were ready to become
warriors.

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:11.520
Charitable donations of clothing to Africa
have led to the collapse of its textile industry.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:17.100
A quarter of all the vegetables eaten in the
US are French fries.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:24.229
The phrase 'pipe dream' originates from the
fantasies one experiences when smoking opium.

00:01:24.229 --> 00:01:29.780
A study conducted in Switzerland revealed
that stockbrokers are more reckless and manipulative

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:36.630
than diagnosed psychopaths.
Stalin hated his own son so much that when

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:43.450
he failed to commit suicide by shooting himself,
Stalin only commented “He can't even shoot

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:48.440
straight”.
The mortality rate of pop stars is 1.7 times

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:53.780
higher than average.
'Misspell' is one of the most commonly misspelled

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.750
words in the English language.

